** AUTHORED TEMPLATE — diff_pair/gain_dc (plan D-4): differential DC gain of a differential pair.
** Sweeps the differential input vid about the common-mode (vinp = vcm + vid/2, vinn = vcm - vid/2
** via VCVSs) and extracts the small-signal differential gain d(voutp-voutn)/d(vid) from a two-point
** slope across vid=0. Bindings: DUT PORT_LINE VDD VCM IBIAS, VID_LO VID_HI VID_STEP, PDK_INCLUDE.
.lib cornerMOSlv.lib mos_tt
.temp 27

.param VDD=1.5
.param VCM=0.75
.param IBIAS=20u

Vdd   vdd 0 dc {VDD}
Vss   vss 0 dc 0
Ibias vdd ibias dc {IBIAS}
Vcm   vcm 0 dc {VCM}
Vid   vid 0 dc 0
Einp  vinp vcm vid 0 0.5
Einn  vinn vcm vid 0 -0.5

XDUT vdd voutp voutn vinp vinn ibias vss dp_001_resistive_load

.control
  set filetype=ascii
  dc Vid -0.05 0.05 0.002
  let vdiff = v(voutp) - v(voutn)
  meas dc vd_lo FIND vdiff AT=-0.01
  meas dc vd_hi FIND vdiff AT=0.01
  * magnitude of the differential gain (the pair is inverting in the p-minus-n convention)
  let gain_dc = abs((vd_hi - vd_lo) / 0.02)
  print gain_dc
  write
  quit
.endc
.param x_dut_xmp_w=12u
.param x_dut_xmp_l=0.3u
.param x_dut_rp_value=22000
.param x_dut_xmt_w=24u
